<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Furniture Brands.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Furniture Brands.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised Furniture Brands International Inc's near-term rating to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- Furniture Brands gained 1/4 to 14-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
